                   OLFB New Features!!

 ====++++**** Check out the "Sysop Challenge" !! ****++++====

 You now have the option to turn OFF the Ball Animation.

 You also have the option to adjust the Text Display Speed
 for this game!

 Both Features can greatly speed up the game and may be very
 desireable if you are calling at 2400 baud or less! You'll
 find these features in the "Options" menu inside the game.

 All NEW games will now Pit you against other players of OLFB
 rather than against the "AMIGA".

 Get in there and compete against the best of them!